{"skill":{"slug":"competitor-analysis","displayName":"Competitor Analysis"},"version":{"version":"19.0.0","createdAt":1784903008962,"changelog":"- Major documentation rewrite with expanded instructions, clearer usage scenarios, and detailed analysis steps.\n- Improved guidelines for competitor identification and decision gates.\n- Enhanced output expectations, including mandatory evidence labeling for each finding.\n- Clarified handoff, reporting, and data-source integration requirements.\n- Added references to advanced analysis types and supporting materials.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7998,"sha256":"7da4bdcd67fdc81f9fe7ef95526989bb37e6073740111cf982ce81578de1a6df","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"distribution-manifest.json","size":1749,"sha256":"f8ab6a1cc21f3dbac81cd525edb8c5d4c53a446afa0dcf2de73711608d8e0046","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/analysis-templates.md","size":3790,"sha256":"a04b96352a32e76aacb79462411f13e736f483f6ac89a4acf0bdd6d8b8380a08","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/battlecard-template.md","size":4198,"sha256":"89a2d9e941bf25652a403ae34d7292b4eb2be30dddd9ccd36bd63a04c5a11a3b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/example-report.md","size":2259,"sha256":"002c32f1b514ef064c8ba37c9e2c16d6df0f5addfd890ee55a7584058ed95f3f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/positioning-frameworks.md","size":4799,"sha256":"fcafeaddf6137096235201bbf3b4cc080839a75748abd82965bcc4dcba11b7b9","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2612,"sha256":"31fe247b1aada6eeb191ff988e9a630ea483cd5c91eb3b183ee7767600ca6199","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789053349094,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b33b2364ceb3ade4e6ae91921f335e133e6a6aba58c7e9e4db926f872d06373d","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b33b2364ceb3ade4e6ae91921f335e133e6a6aba58c7e9e4db926f872d06373d","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1784906519836},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789053349094},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed competitor-analysis workflow with proportionate use of SEO data, public web research, and optional memory handoff.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill may use optional SEO, analytics, AI-monitoring tools, and a Firecrawl connector for competitor-page scraping if available; this is purpose-aligned, disclosed, and bounded to competitor research.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package is a standalone markdown skill with reference markdown files and a distribution manifest; no executable scripts, dependency installation, or privileged setup is included.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to producing competitor briefs, labeling metric provenance, asking for competitor names when needed, and handing off to adjacent marketing skills; no prompt hijacking, hidden role changes, or unrelated commands were found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill explicitly asks to save reusable competitor research into memory paths such as memory/research and memory/hot-cache.md; this persistence is disclosed and related to the workflow, but users should be aware that business/competitor notes may be retained.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is competitor SEO/GEO analysis, and the instructions align with that by gathering competitor domains, keyword rankings, backlinks, traffic estimates, content patterns, technical SEO, and AI citation signals.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want an agent to help with competitor SEO and positioning research. Expect it to use provided business context, optional SEO/analytics data, public web scraping/search tools if available, and to save durable competitor research notes unless you direct the agent not to persist them.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789053349094}}}}}